messages[16]{user,text}:
  user_2,[00:00] Good morning, this is Vikram Patel from Omni Insurance Group, calling from DCoders. Am I speaking with Sneha?
  user_1,[00:05] Umm, yes, hi. This is Sneha.
  user_2,[00:10] Thanks, Sneha. I wanted to discuss your health policy—policy number HP-4478—it's set to expire soon.
  user_1,[00:15] Oh, really? I didn't realize that. When does it expire?
  user_2,[00:20] It expires on 30/09/2026, so just a few days away.
  user_1,[00:25] Ah, okay... I guess I need to decide whether to renew or let it lapse.
  user_2,[00:30] Sure, we have a few options—renew as is, upgrade coverage, or let it go. Any preferences?
  user_1,[00:35] Umm... I think I might want to keep the same coverage, but I'm not sure about the premium.
  user_2,[00:40] Got it. Let me pull up the renewal quote—[typing]... Okay, the premium would be $210 per month, up from $190.
  user_1,[00:45] That's a bit higher... can we maybe get a discount? --
  user_2,[00:48] -- Yeah, we can check if any loyalty discount applies. One moment.
  user_2,[00:55] [sighs] Looks like you qualify for a 5% discount, bringing it to $199.50.
  user_1,[01:00] That's better. I think I'll go ahead with the renewal.
  user_2,[01:05] Great! I'll send you the renewal documents via email. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,[01:10] No, that's all. Thanks, Vikram.
  user_2,[01:12] You're welcome, Sneha. Have a good day!